Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.14,0:01:28.87,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(833.208,1026)}{\fad(90,90)}真
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.19,0:01:28.92,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(896.604,1026)}{\fad(90,90)}是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.24,0:01:28.97,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1026)}{\fad(90,90)}太
